## AuxiNux Virtua kernel repository — persists on the INSTALLED system so the
## hypervisor kernel (kernel-virtua / 7.x-auxinux-virtua) can be upgraded with
## `apt update && apt full-upgrade`.
## The keyring below is installed at build time by build.sh (fetched from
## https://dep.auxinux.ca/VIRTUA/virtua-archive-keyring.asc). apt accepts an
## ASCII-armored keyring directly in Signed-By, so no dearmoring is required.
Types: deb
URIs: https://dep.auxinux.ca/VIRTUA
Suites: kernel
Components: main
Architectures: amd64
Signed-By: /usr/share/keyrings/virtua-archive-keyring.asc
